[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2944238698","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107132#issuecomment-2944238698","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107132","id":2944238698,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vfYRq","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T13:08:42Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T13:08:42Z","body":"Did you include the polyfills per [this tutorial](https://www.snopekgames.com/tutorial/2023/how-make-vr-game-webxr-godot-4)?\n\nBasically, just adding this code to **Head Include** in export settings:\n\n```\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/webxr-polyfill@latest/build/webxr-polyfill.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\nvar polyfill = new WebXRPolyfill();\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/webxr-layers-polyfill@latest/build/webxr-layers-polyfill.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\nvar layersPolyfill = new WebXRLayersPolyfill();\n</script>\n```\n\nThe 2nd one being the more important one here, which adds support for WebXR Layers on browsers that don't support it natively. Based on the error message, that sounds like what you need.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2944238698/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2944980826","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107132#issuecomment-2944980826","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107132","id":2944980826,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6viNda","user":{"login":"netAction","id":1829847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4Mjk4NDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1829847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction","html_url":"https://github.com/netAction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T15:24:49Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T15:32:40Z","body":"Thanks a lot for your great work for so many years. I saw the tutorial but didn't try it. Yes, the Polyfill seems to help. The browser switches to a black screen with white bar now. \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7cf8d9b-d7c1-4695-b8ab-8288d4fe0c72)\n\nSeems to be the same behaviour like they described: https://forum.godotengine.org/t/webxr-export-showing-black-screen-in-mobile-brows\n\nThe console starts with this:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f7c56660-8ee3-4050-971d-98b7abacd123)\n\nCould not create render target, status: 36055 at: _update_render_target (drivers /gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp:2228)\n\nThen comes a lot of source code, followed by this which repeats multiple times:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb52b658-bd6d-44a2-a1ee-7954f2202411)\n\nError: SkyShaderGLES3: Vertex shader compilation failed: GL_OVR_multiview2: extension is not supported\n\nAfter tapping The Android back button triangle, I am back in the window mode and can see a static 3D rendering of my scene. It even depends on the angle the phone has been hold at while it showed the black screen.\n\nI am not sure if this is the same bug or completely different, that's why I describe it here.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2944980826/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2945087752","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107132#issuecomment-2945087752","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107132","id":2945087752,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vinkI","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T15:57:04Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T15:57:04Z","body":"Thanks for testing and the further info!\n\nIt sounds like your phone doesn't support multiview rendering, and, starting with Godot 4.0, Godot can only do stereo rendering via multiview.\n\nSo, at this point, this is probably the same as issue https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/85422\n\nHowever, are you trying to make a Google cardboard style VR app? Or, an AR app?\n\nBecause if your goal is to do AR, that doesn't need multiview (because it's not stereo), which should work on your phone. You just need to change \"immersive-vr\" to \"immersive-ar\"","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2945087752/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2945274752","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107132#issuecomment-2945274752","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107132","id":2945274752,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vjVOA","user":{"login":"netAction","id":1829847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4Mjk4NDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1829847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction","html_url":"https://github.com/netAction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/netAction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T16:57:37Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T16:57:37Z","body":"I understand, cardbord is hardly supported. I do not need cardboard. The change to \"immersive-ar\" solved all issues. Now everything works, both on regular phones with current Chrome browser and on the Meta Quest 2. Thank you. I hope at least I put some keywords in this issue for others. Maybe one day there are better error messages than the crashes.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2945274752/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954215000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107132#issuecomment-2954215000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107132","id":2954215000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wFb5Y","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T18:29:40Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T18:29:40Z","body":"I just posted PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107288 which attempts to give better error messages","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954215000/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]